<fw type="sig" place="bottom">P 2</fw><fw type="catch" place="bottom">thun</fw><lb/>
<pb n="228" facs="#f0240"/>
<hi rendition="#et">thun &#x017F;ie der heftig und &#x017F;chnell ausdehnenden<lb/>
